# 17. Regression tests

Добавить тесты.

### Test 1 — Holding root

```text
Root
├── Directorate A
│   ├── Department A1
│   └── Department A2
├── Directorate B
│   └── Department B1
└── Directorate C
```

После initial render:

```js
visible:
Root
Directorate A
Directorate B
Directorate C
```

Не visible:

```text
Department A1
Department A2
Department B1
```

### Test 2 — expand A

После:

```js
toggleCollapse(DirectorateA)
```

видны:

```text
Department A1
Department A2
```

Но:

```text
Department B1
```

остается скрытым.

### Test 3 — select Directorate A directly

Если selected root:

```text
Directorate A
```

не применять holding-level auto-collapse.

### Test 4 — root has no children

Не падать с ошибкой.

### Test 5 — zoom/pan

После initial fit:

```text
zoom
pan
expand Directorate A
```

viewport не сбрасывается.

